4	/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
5	   QOE.FI — Design System
6	   
7	   Single source of truth for all theme tokens.
8	   Uses shadcn/ui semantic variables for consistency.
9	   Light and dark themes defined via :root / .dark.
10	   Extensible: add new themes via CSS classes.
11	   ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
